<div class="card">
  <a href="/articles/<%= @article.id %>" class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" style="float:right">← Back</a>
  <h1>Diff: <%= @article.title %></h1>
  <p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">v<%= @from %> → v<%= @to %></p>

  <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:16px;font-size:13px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <span style="color:#155724">+<%= @diff.insertions %> insertions</span>
    <span style="color:#721c24">−<%= @diff.deletions %> deletions</span>
    <span style="color:#8a6d3b">~<%= @diff.replacements %> replacements</span>
    <span style="color:#555"><%= @diff.stats["total"] %> total edits</span>
  </div>
  <p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">
    Each edit is a contiguous run of changes collapsed into one entry, with real
    character offsets and line numbers on both sides. insertions and deletions are
    pure; a changed span counts once as a replacement, not as one of each.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="overflow-x:auto">
  <h2>Line diff (HTML render)</h2>
  <% html = @diff.to_html %>
  <% if html.strip.empty? %>
    <p style="color:#888;font-size:13px">Versions are identical.</p>
  <% else %>
    <%== html %>
  <% end %>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>JSON diff</h2>
  <pre style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:12px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;overflow-x:auto"><%= JSON.pretty_generate(@diff.as_json) %></pre>
  <p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">
    Served raw at
    <a href="/articles/<%= @article.id %>/diff.json?from=<%= @from %>&amp;to=<%= @to %>">diff.json</a>
    — a <strong>nested</strong> payload, the shape third-party clients consume.
    Before <code>Diff::Result#as_json</code> existed, the <code>diff</code> key there
    lost <code>stats</code> and emitted <code>line</code> instead of
    <code>position</code>.
  </p>
</div>
